=Research and qualify exactly one target account for a potential Knoxx ingredient-supply opportunity.

Target company supplied by user: {{ $json.company_name || '(resolve from evidence)' }}
Website: {{ $json.website_url }}
Sales notes and constraints: {{ $json.notes || '(none supplied)' }}
Crawl status: {{ $json.evidence.crawl_partial ? 'partial' : 'complete' }}
Crawl error: {{ $json.evidence.crawl_error || '(none)' }}
Evidence pages: {{ JSON.stringify($json.evidence.pages) }}

Follow the system research procedure. Call Knoxx_Catalogue_Lookup separately for each canonical ingredient that may map to the portfolio. Return only the structured object required by the output parser. Do not include prose outside that object.

